      "id": "sentence_3",
      "input": "This TUI is amazing!",
      "context": "Analyze the sentiment of this sentence. Determine if it's positive, negative, or neutral, and provide a brief explanation of your reasoning."
    }
  ],
  "totalItems": 3
}
```

